   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Cape Cod Cannabis Dispensary in Wellfleet"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><img src=\"assets/source/25305728-CCC_Logo_650px-geo-tag-1-300x254.jpg\" alt=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"300\" height=\"254\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/CCC_Logo_650px-geo-tag-1-300x254.jpg?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/1a7e34ec-CCC_Logo_650px-geo-tag-1.jpg\"></p><p>At Cape Cod Cannabis, Wellfleet’s first dispensary, our mission is to cultivate a vibrant and sustainable cannabis community, rooted in the spirit of the Cape, where the beauty of the region is celebrated through responsible and innovative cannabis practices. We are committed to providing our customers with the highest quality cannabis products while promoting education, accessibility, and well-being.</p><p>We believe in the power of cannabis to enhance lives, alleviate pain, and foster a sense of wellness. Our dedicated team is passionate about delivering safe and reliable cannabis products that meet the diverse needs of our community. We are driven by a commitment to quality, transparency, and sustainability in all aspects of our operations.</p><p>Cape Cod Cannabis Dispensary in Wellfleet offers the largest selection of quality products and the best prices on Cape Cod. Our product assortment includes <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/drinks/\">beverages</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vaporizers</a>, <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\">tinctures</a>, <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a>, <a href=\"/categories/cbd/\">CBD products</a>, <a href=\"/categories/topicals/\">topicals</a>, <a href=\"/categories/Seeds/\">seeds</a>, <a href=\"/categories/accessories/\">smoking accessories</a> and <a href=\"/categories/merch/\">branded apparel</a> <em>(need our Apparel shipped to you? Visit <a href=\"https://www.bluetail.cc/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.BlueTail.cc</a> to order)</em>.</p><p>Our knowledgeable and friendly staff will ensure that you have a pleasant and informed shopping experience and our security staff ensure convenient and safe parking in our designated spaces during the store’s operating hours.</p><p><em>Cape Cod Cannabis Dispensary in Wellfleet…it’s worth the trip!</em></p>"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
